<% layout("./layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

<main class="privacy mx-auto my-5" style="max-width: 50rem;">
    <header class="mb-5">
        <p class="text-uppercase text-muted small fw-semibold mb-2">Dwellr</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-0">
            Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what information Dwellr collects,
            how we use it, and the choices available to you.
        </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account data:</strong> name, email, phone number, and password.</li>
            <li><strong>Property data:</strong> listings, images, amenities, and availability.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and interaction logs.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment data:</strong> processed securely through third-party providers.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Provide booking and hosting services.</li>
            <li>Verify identity and help prevent fraud.</li>
            <li>Improve the user experience and personalize content.</li>
            <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">3. Sharing of Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Hosts and guests:</strong> limited information may be shared to support bookings.</li>
            <li><strong>Third-party services:</strong> information may be shared with payment gateways, cloud storage, and map providers.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> information may be shared with authorities when required by law.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">4. Data Security</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Sensitive information is stored using appropriate security measures.</li>
            <li>HTTPS is used to protect information during transmission.</li>
            <li>Role-based access controls help limit internal access.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2 class="h4">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Access, update, or delete your personal data.</li>
            <li>Opt out of marketing communications.</li>
            <li>Request account deletion at any time.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>